/**
 * @file namespaces.dox
 * @brief Namespace documentation for Doxygen/Coverxygen.
 *
 * Coverxygen counts namespace-level documentation as part of documentation coverage.
 * Java projects normally use packages, but Doxygen still emits namespaces for internal
 * groupings (e.g. {@code com}, {@code com::eceirem}). Document them once here.
 */

/** @namespace com
 *  @brief Root namespace for the project packages.
 */

/** @namespace com::eceirem
 *  @brief Organization namespace used by the Kidsplanner packages.
 */

/** @namespace com::eceirem::kidsplanner
 *  @brief Main application package containing domain, UI, and repositories.
 */

/** @namespace java::lang
 *  @brief Java standard library namespace used in generated output.
 */

/** @namespace java
 *  @brief Root namespace for generated Java standard library namespaces.
 */

